yle=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺獨立廚房：料理台、電陶爐、櫻花牌廚具(抽風機、烘碗機)🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺乾濕分離衛浴：超大淋浴間、免治馬桶、冷暖乾燥機🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺工作陽台：恆溫熱水器、升降晾衣架🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺門戶管理：分棟門禁管理、分層管控電梯🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺物業管理保安、車道安全管理、社區監控、公區保潔🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">🔺建商房東一條龍服務–自租、自營、自管有保障🔺</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><br><br></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 255);\"><strong>Ocean&nbsp;City&nbsp;租賃服務中心營業時間：10:00~19:00</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">服務專線：02-2625-3848</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">賞屋地址：新北市淡水區新市五路三段398號1F</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">LineID：@ocean_city</span></p>"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "海洋都心3 淡水區新市五路三段", "lat": "25.1987535", "lng": "121.4392208", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "美麗新廣場站", "distance": 108, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約108公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "崁頂61號站", "distance": 217, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約217公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "崁頂66號站", "distance": 219, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約219公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "小島3.5度-Island Aurora 淡海漂流館", "distance": 38, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約38公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "Ocean Square海都廣場", "distance": 68, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約68公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市淡水區育英國民小學", "distance": 597, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約597公尺"}, {"type": "university", "name": "台北海洋科技大學 淡水校區", "distance